      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2008 Elsevier Ireland Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "Simultaneous drug-eluting stent thrombosis in multivessel disease is a low incidence, but could cause lethal clinical event. We report a case with death caused by simultaneous subacute stent thrombosis of sirolimus-eluting stents in the proximal left anterior descending artery and in the proximal left circumflex artery."
      },
